      "role": "user",
      "content": "the gardener analogy is a bit weird lol but i get what you mean. can u just explain the actual math though? like how exactly is the interest calculated every month so i can see where my money is actually going? i want to see the breakdown of how interest is taken out vs the principal on a monthly basis.",
